<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1717034386"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:26.780"><div begin="14.954" end="40.184" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="14.954" end="21.119" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.954" end="15.322">今</span><span begin="15.322" end="15.763">天</span><span begin="15.763" end="16.630">我</span> <span begin="18.454" end="18.968">寒夜</span><span begin="18.968" end="19.328">里</span><span begin="19.328" end="19.514">看</span><span begin="19.514" end="19.933">雪</span><span begin="19.933" end="20.481">飘</span><span begin="20.481" end="21.119">过</span></p><p begin="21.626" end="26.201" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.626" end="22.115">怀着</span><span begin="22.115" end="22.512">冷</span><span begin="22.512" end="22.742">却</span><span begin="22.742" end="23.262">了</span><span begin="23.262" end="23.566">的</span><span begin="23.566" end="24.462">心窝</span><span begin="24.462" end="25.028">漂远</span><span begin="25.028" end="26.201">方</span></p><p begin="27.498" end="33.503" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.498" end="28.357">风雨</span><span begin="28.357" end="29.454">里</span><span begin="29.558" end="29.953">追</span><span begin="29.953" end="30.573">赶</span> <span begin="30.741" end="31.515">雾里</span><span begin="31.515" end="31.987">分</span><span begin="31.987" end="32.496">不清</span><span begin="32.496" end="32.967">影</span><span begin="32.967" end="33.503">踪</span></p><p begin="33.920" end="40.184" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.920" end="34.350">天</span><span begin="34.350" end="34.601">空</span><span begin="34.601" end="35.121">海</span><span begin="35.121" end="35.420">阔</span><span begin="35.561" end="35.938">你</span><span begin="35.938" end="36.186">与</span><span begin="36.186" end="36.636">我</span> <span begin="37.047" end="37.523">可</span><span begin="37.523" end="37.877">会</span><span begin="37.877" end="38.824">变</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="38.256" end="38.717">(谁</span><span 